{"step_index":286,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:42:41Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. this window should not at the welcome page .. it must display after a user have  have the write to verify ahs log in to the system not to dispaly on teh welcome page  \n2. continue \n3.  on this part you should log in so that u can verify  the second screen shot ut should be at the center not at the corner as it is .  the third secreen l think its proper  to be on the welcome page .  is the AI asssintant wroking . it seems its halusinating . is there any access levels between admin ,officer , on that last screen shot . l think they should be diffent on one access and one does not access . lets correct that \n4. lets a light background which is professional .not dark blue \n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: Change the UI color scheme from dark navy/slate blue (`#0f172a`, `#1e293b`) to a **clean, professional light background** across the web application (not dark blue).\n- **Previous Requests Completed**:\n  - Relocated verification search card and result box from `index.html` (welcome page) to `dashboard.html` (authenticated console).\n  - Centered `login.html` horizontally and vertically in the middle of the viewport.\n  - Eliminated confusing secondary \"Access Portal Dashboard\" button on `index.html`, leaving a direct \"Sign In to Verify Credentials\" CTA.\n  - Retained public \"Cryptographic Block Stream\" on `index.html` for ledger transparency.\n  - Resolved AI Assistant hallucinations by connecting `AiFraudDetectionService.processUserQuery()` to real database queries (`QualificationRepository`).\n  - Differentiated access levels for `ROLE_VERIFIER`, `ROLE_INSTITUTION` (Officer), and `ROLE_ADMIN` (Admin) on both frontend and backend.\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Files Modified & Verified with `mvn \n<truncated 4257 bytes>\nf0; color: #64748b;`).\n   - Ensure mobile nav menu (`@media (max-width: 768px) .nav-menu`) uses light background (`#ffffff`) with dark links instead of `#0f172a`.\n2. **Review templates for inline dark styles**:\n   - Check `index.html`, `dashboard.html`, `login.html`, and `audit.html` for any hardcoded dark navbar/footer styles.\n3. **Run Maven build & tests**:\n   - Run `mvn clean test` to ensure zero regressions and Checkstyle compliance.\n4. **Present the results clearly to the user**.\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- The user explicitly insisted: *\"lets a light background which is professional .not dark blue\"*. Do NOT keep dark navy/slate blue backgrounds for the hero or page headers. Ensure high contrast, crisp typography, and an enterprise aesthetic.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 6 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1788685134552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dc839fa4-98d6-4745-b830-99f0adf261cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788685134552.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-06T09:00:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1788700723069]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dc839fa4-98d6-4745-b830-99f0adf261cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788700723069.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-06T13:26:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1788700808860]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dc839fa4-98d6-4745-b830-99f0adf261cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788700808860.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-06T13:26:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1788700941001]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dc839fa4-98d6-4745-b830-99f0adf261cc/.user_uploaded/media_1788700941001.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-06T13:26:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1788701043533]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dc839f